# ===== OS junk =====
# .DS_Store was previously tracked in this repo, which means every macOS
# visitor who opened the folder produced a dirty working tree.
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ===== Local tool state =====
# Dot-prefixed paths are already excluded from the published site by Jekyll,
# but they are not excluded from git. These are machine-local only.
.claude/
.workbuddy-ai/
.oma/

# ===== Editors =====
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
